# 두 시각 사이의 변경과 그 변경이 넣고 뺀 트리플 (시점별 판 비교). {{SINCE}}, {{UNTIL}}은 xsd:dateTime
# 승인과 승인을 거둔 정정(action이 withdraw) 둘 다 나온다. 제안의 대상은 제안을 대상에 잇는 사건에서 읽는다
PREFIX jgk: <https://yeodh10.github.io/jeungmi-geokg/def#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?order ?decidedAt ?proposal ?action ?target ?op ?s ?p ?o WHERE {
  ?c jgk:changeOf ?proposal ; jgk:decidedAt ?decidedAt ; jgk:proposalAction ?action ; jgk:changeOrder ?order ;
     jgk:changeOp ?op ; rdf:subject ?s ; rdf:predicate ?p ; rdf:object ?o .
  FILTER (?decidedAt > "{{SINCE}}"^^xsd:dateTime && ?decidedAt <= "{{UNTIL}}"^^xsd:dateTime)
  FILTER (?p != prov:wasInfluencedBy)
  ?link jgk:changeOf ?proposal ; rdf:predicate prov:wasInfluencedBy ; rdf:subject ?target .
} ORDER BY ?order
